<div class="pom-page pom-page-home">
  <section class="pom-hero is-pew" data-pom-region="home-hero">
    <div class="pom-hero-copy pom-fallback">
      <h1>Faith. Hope.<br>A place to belong.</h1>
      <p class="pom-lede">Sharing God’s love in our communities<br>and beyond.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-hero-bars">
      <a class="pom-hero-bar is-light" href="/events"><span>Join Saturday Night Live</span> <span class="pom-arrow is-ne" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
      <a class="pom-hero-bar is-dark" href="/about"><span>Explore Our Ministry</span> <span class="pom-arrow is-ne" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="home-hero" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-triptych" data-pom-region="home-purpose" aria-label="Our purpose">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-panel">
        <div>
          <p class="pom-eyebrow">Our Purpose</p>
          <h2>A light in every community.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pom-media is-hands" role="img" aria-label="People gathered with open Bibles"></div>
      <div class="pom-panel">
        <div>
          <p>For over 30 years, we’ve reached people with compassion, Christian fellowship, and the encouragement of God’s Word.</p>
          <a class="pom-link" href="/about">About Pacesetters <span class="pom-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="home-purpose" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-split is-cream" id="saturday-night-live" data-pom-region="home-snl">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-media is-bible" role="img" aria-label="Open Bible and microphone"></div>
      <div class="pom-split-copy">
        <p class="pom-eyebrow">Weekly · Online via Zoom</p>
        <h2>Saturday night live</h2>
        <p>Preaching, music, and prayer with Pastor Michael Vance.</p>
        <a class="pom-link" href="/events">View Program &amp; Join <span class="pom-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="home-saturday" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-split is-dark is-store is-reverse" data-pom-region="home-store-promo">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-split-copy">
        <h2>Encouragement for everyday faith.</h2>
        <p>Music, sermons, and books from our ministry.</p>
        <a class="pom-link is-end" href="/store">Browse the Store <span class="pom-arrow is-ne" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="pom-media is-books" role="img" aria-label="Books, CDs, and headphones"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="home-store-promo" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-testimonials" data-pom-region="home-testimonials" aria-label="Testimonials">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-testimonials-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="pom-eyebrow">Testimonials</p>
          <h2>Stories of faith<br>and hope.</h2>
          <div class="pom-quote-nav">
            <button class="pom-icon-btn is-prev" type="button" data-quote="prev" aria-label="Previous story"><span class="pom-arrow"></span></button>
            <button class="pom-icon-btn is-next" type="button" data-quote="next" aria-label="Next story"><span class="pom-arrow"></span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pom-quote-wrap" data-quotes>
        <blockquote class="pom-quote is-active">
          <div class="pom-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Neque rhoncus et quis in pretium augue commodo. Eget est erat auctor sit nunc urna dolor massa eget. Aliquet praesent in laoreet orci turpis et faucibus. Egestas malesuada a ut auctor euismod.</p>
          <cite>— Jane Doe</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="pom-quote">
          <div class="pom-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
          <p>Being part of this community has strengthened my faith and given me a place to belong. Every gathering reminds me that God’s love is near.</p>
          <cite>— Michael R.</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="pom-quote">
          <div class="pom-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
          <p>Saturday Night Live connects us even when we are far apart. The teaching and prayer leave me encouraged for the week ahead.</p>
          <cite>— Sarah L.</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="home-testimonials" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-faq" data-pom-region="home-faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-faq-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="pom-eyebrow">FAQ</p>
          <h2>A few helpful<br>answers.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pom-faq-list" data-accordion>
        <div class="pom-faq-item is-open">
          <button class="pom-faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="true">How can I join Saturday Night Live? <span class="pom-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="pom-faq-a">Visit the program page for current Zoom meeting details.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-faq-item">
          <button class="pom-faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can I request prayer? <span class="pom-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="pom-faq-a">Yes. Reach out through our contact form or email and our team will pray with you and for you.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-faq-item">
          <button class="pom-faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">How can I get involved? <span class="pom-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="pom-faq-a">Join Saturday Night Live, serve in outreach, or support the ministry store. Contact us and we’ll help you take the next step.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-faq-item">
          <button class="pom-faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">What can I find in the store? <span class="pom-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="pom-faq-a">Music &amp; CDs, sermons, and books for everyday encouragement and faith.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="home-faq" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-contact is-crowd" id="get-in-touch" data-pom-region="home-contact">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-contact-copy">
        <p class="pom-eyebrow">Get in Touch</p>
        <h2>We’d love to hear from you.</h2>
        <p class="pom-contact-lead">Have a question, need prayer, or want to help?</p>
        <div class="pom-contact-meta is-icons">
          <a href="tel:3305059087">330 505-9087 <span class="pom-meta-icon is-phone" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
          <a href="mailto:terryolivia@currently.com">terryolivia@currently.com <span class="pom-meta-icon is-mail" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <form class="pom-form-card" data-contact-form action="/contact" method="post">
        <div class="pom-field"><label for="home-name">Name</label><input id="home-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name"></div>
        <div class="pom-field"><label for="home-email">Email</label><input id="home-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email"></div>
        <div class="pom-field"><label for="home-message">Message</label><textarea id="home-message" name="message" rows="3"></textarea></div>
        <button class="pom-link" type="submit">Send Message <span class="pom-arrow is-ne" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <p class="pom-form-note" hidden>Thank you. Add a Squarespace Form block in this region to deliver messages.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="home-contact" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>
</div>
